    Bug 2051767 - Cast char16_t * to nsString before converting to UTF8. r=aleca

    I could convert much of this from char pointers to string types, but let's just fix the casting
    and move on, avoiding the risk of making another bug.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D309736

diff --git a/mailnews/search/src/nsMsgSearchNews.cpp b/mailnews/search/src/nsMsgSearchNews.cpp
index d61828783f5..57178f66fb8 100644
--- a/mailnews/search/src/nsMsgSearchNews.cpp
+++ b/mailnews/search/src/nsMsgSearchNews.cpp
@@ -142,7 +142,7 @@ char* nsMsgSearchNews::EncodeTerm(nsIMsgSearchTerm* term) {
   nsAutoCString pattern;

   if (leadingStar) pattern.Append('*');
-  pattern.Append(NS_ConvertUTF16toUTF8(caseInsensitiveValue));
+  pattern.Append(NS_ConvertUTF16toUTF8(nsString(caseInsensitiveValue)));
   free(caseInsensitiveValue);
   if (trailingStar) pattern.Append('*');
